1: // What: translates one audited prompt to the five approved provider APIs and validates their replies.
2: // Why: only PGN plus computed text leaves main; provider-specific JSON never reaches the renderer.
3: // Removed: provider payloads would be unvalidated and errors could leak secrets or response data.
4: import { z } from 'zod';
